live reload, next version!!!
	stop with all this multi request stuff,
	when the client asks for a chunk which is partial, the server:
		sends what is has straight away (it is now completed)
		triggers the emitter to emit until max value of that chunk
		when the emitter gets outside of that max value, it checks if there are any future (now current) chunks in the chunk list
			if there are, it triggers line 5 again with new max value
		
		chunk is removed from the chunk list when it is picked up for emission
		future chunks are left in the chunk list until they're picked up for emission

		when it emits, it checks if it's still completed, if not cancel the subscription, we've forgotten about it
			this is because the client might be scrolling away and stuff
			if the client comes back, it'll just get the dump as if from the beginning
